          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "In Melbourne, the market for luxury off-the-plan developments, sub-penthouses/penthouses, and architectural project marketing is divided into **blue-chip prestige agencies** (which specialize in boutique, design-led developments for local high-net-worth downsizers) and **global/specialist project marketers** (which handle iconic towers, large master-planned luxury, and international reach).\n\nThe primary market leaders across these categories include:\n\n---\n\n### 1. The Blue-Chip Prestige Specialists\nThese firms dominate Melbourne’s inner east, Stonnington, Boroondara, and Bayside (Toorak, South Yarra, Armadale, East Melbourne, Brighton). They leverage private client books of affluent local buyers and downsizers.\n\n* **Kay & Burton Projects**  \n  * **Profile:** Kay & Burton is widely considered the benchmark for ultra-luxury in Victoria. Their dedicated Projects division specializes in curated, low-density, highly architectural developments and flagship penthouses.  \n  * **Niche:** Blue-chip owner-occupiers, downsizers, and high-net-worth families looking for \"house-alternative\" living.  \n  * **Signature Locations:** Toorak, East Melbourne, South Yarra, Armadale, and the Mornington Peninsula.\n\n* **Marshall White Projects**  \n  * **Profile:** One of the most dominant forces in Melbourne’s luxury multi-residential market. They collaborate with top-tier developers, prominent architects (e.g., Woods Bagot, Carr, Rob Mills), and elite landscape designers (e.g., Paul Bangay, Jack Merlo).  \n  * **Niche:** Boutique townhome and apartment collections, bespoke sky homes, and luxury suburban infill.  \n  * **Signature Locations:** Melbourne’s Inner East (Malvern, Hawthorn, Kew), Stonnington, and the Bayside corridor.\n\n* **RT Edgar (Projects & Developments)**  \n  * **Profile:** An established prestige heritage brand that regularly markets boutique, high-end new builds and small collections of architectural residences.  \n  * **Niche:** Ultra-discreet marketing, bespoke multi-residential builds, and coastal luxury retreats.  \n  * **Signature Locations:** Toorak, Brighton, Portsea, Sorrento, and Flinders.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Global Powerhouses (Landmark Towers & Sky Homes)\nFor marquee towers, hotel-branded residences, and major city skyline penthouses, global commercial agencies with specialized residential divisions take the lead.\n\n* **Colliers Residential Victoria**  \n  * **Profile:** A market leader for major project marketing campaigns. They frequently handle Melbourne's most complex, trophy-level penthouses and mixed-use five-star hotel residences.  \n  * **Track Record:** Projects like *Collins Arch* (and its record-breaking penthouses) and *Sapphire by the Gardens / Shangri-La*.  \n  * **Strengths:** Strong dual-market reach connecting wealthy local buyers with an extensive pan-Asian offshore network.\n\n* **CBRE Residential Projects**  \n  * **Profile:** Similar to Colliers, CBRE is retained by institutional and private developers delivering landmark, large-scale luxury projects (such as *STH BNK by Beulah*).  \n  * **Strengths:** Ability to market ultra-luxury penthouse penthouses and premium residences on a global stage.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Dedicated Project Marketing & Advisory Boutiques\nUnlike traditional agencies with project arms, these firms focus purely on project marketing strategy, product mix advisory, and developer partnerships from concept to settlement.\n\n* **Castran Gilbert / Castran**  \n  * **Profile:** A long-standing, aggressive player in Melbourne’s project marketing sphere with decades of presence in the inner-city and fringe apartment sectors.  \n  * **Niche:** Broad range from urban regeneration and high-density apartments to luxury alpine and boutique inner-fringe projects.\n\n* **Three Sixty° Property Group (360)**  \n  * **Profile:** A specialist advisory and sales marketing firm working directly alongside developers to shape floorplans, pricing architecture, and launch strategies.  \n  * **Track Record:** Frequently chosen for design-led, mid-rise developments and architectural penthouses across fringe-city precincts (South Melbourne, Fitzroy, Collingwood).\n\n* **Co-Lab Residential**  \n  * **Profile:** Founded by seasoned luxury project directors (such as Michael Robinson and Daniel Cashen).  \n  * **Niche:** High-end boutique suburban projects, tailoring campaigns specifically for the luxury downsizer demographic in the inner east and bayside.\n\n---\n\n### Summary Checklist for Selection\n* **For a 6-to-20 unit boutique development in Toorak, Armadale, or Brighton aimed at local downsizers:** *Kay & Burton Projects* or *Marshall White Projects* generally hold the most direct, active qualified buyer databases.\n* **For a high-rise CBD/fringe tower with $10M+ crowning penthouses:** *Colliers Residential* or *CBRE* provide the required global platform, cross-border investor reach, and scale.\n* **For design-focused, urban architectural infill:** Specialists like *Three Sixty° Property Group* or *Co-Lab Residential* offer hands-on, end-to-end development advisory.",
              "thoughtSignature": ""
            }
